  Upstream  https://github.com/whjdark/AAGNet
  Licence   MIT - full text at src/occline/aagnet/vendor/AAGNet/LICENSE
            Copyright (c) 2023 whj_dark

  The per-face machining-feature recognition network.  Vendored rather than
  installed because it is published as a research repository, not a package.

  Includes the trained weights used by this pipeline:
      src/occline/aagnet/vendor/AAGNet/weights/weight_on_MFInstseg.pth
