Siemens NX

  Not included, and not includable.  The NX line drives a local NX installation
  through its own executables (NXBIN/step242.exe, NXBIN/run_journal.exe) and
  reads its feature schema (UGII/customization_base.xml).  NX is commercial
  software under Siemens' licence; nothing from it is redistributed here.

  The nx_v1 ontology *quotes* NX's declared class and attribute names, and pins
  the sha256 of the two installed XML files it was derived from, so that what
  was read can be checked against a given install.  No NX code or data file is
  copied into this repository.

  Consequence for anyone without NX: the open-source line runs anyway.  A
  missing or unlicensed NX is recorded as a named degradation
  (`lines.nx = NOT_BUILT` with a reason), never as a failure.


